# Jarvis Trading Lab — environment variables (copy to .env ONLY on your own machine; .env is gitignored).
# Phase 1-2 run fully offline in LOCAL_SIM mode and need NONE of these.
#
# Alpaca PAPER / market-data keys (optional, only for fetching real historical bars).
# Never put LIVE keys here. Never paste keys in chat, config files, reports or git.
APCA_API_KEY_ID=
APCA_API_SECRET_KEY=
#
# DO NOT set a broker base URL. The paper trading endpoint is hardcoded.
# If APCA_API_BASE_URL / ALPACA_BASE_URL is set to anything other than the paper URL,
# the lab refuses to start (fail closed).
